          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{First unit price}&=\\frac{\\$3.24}{6}=\\$0.54\\\\\\text{Second unit price}&=\\frac{\\$4.50}{9}=\\$0.50\\end{align*}$$\nThe second option is the best buy because its price per unit is lower.",
