        "answer": {
          "short": "Same value: both cost \\$0.45 per unit.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{First unit price}&=\\frac{\\$5.40}{12}=\\$0.45\\\\\\text{Second unit price}&=\\frac{\\$7.65}{17}=\\$0.45\\end{align*}$$\nBoth options offer the same value because their prices per unit are equal.",
